    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜つつ: while",
     "texto": [
      "It joins two simultaneous actions and sounds formal or written: stem of the ます form + **つつ**: **なやみつつ、 けっせい しました** (while I was thinking it over, I made a decision).",
      "The contrast is not required; to highlight it, **〜つつも** is often used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜つつある: in progress",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something is changing little by little: verb in the ます form without ます + **つつ ある**: **せかい は かわりつつある** (the world is changing little by little).",
      "It is used a lot in news and analysis."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
